  "content_id": "16136158",
  "title": "Cosmos IBC – Exchange Integration in Edge Wallet",
  "description": "Type: Decentralized Exchange (DEX) Does not have limits or require Know Your Customer (KYC)\nOverview: Cosmos IBC enables decentralized tra...",
  "body": "<p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Type:</b> Decentralized Exchange (DEX) Does not have limits or require Know Your Customer (KYC)</p><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Overview:</b> Cosmos IBC enables decentralized trading across the Cosmos ecosystem using Inter-Blockchain Communication (IBC). It allows for seamless token swaps across multiple Cosmos chains, promoting fast, trustless interoperability.</p><h1 id=\"h_01JSFA2H0ZP8KP9QE0J9ZAYV6H\">How to Manage Exchange Settings in Edge</h1><p class=\"no-margin\">To access your exchange settings in Edge Wallet:</p><ol><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Tap the <b>three lines</b> in the upper right-hand corner</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Tap on <b>Settings</b></p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Tap <b>Exchange Settings</b></p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Here, you can turn exchange partners <b>on or off</b>, and customize your preferences. When multiple exchanges can fill an order, you can also choose to automatically select the best price or prioritize a preferred exchange.</p></li></ol>",
